window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-052-e15f41c1e7224253.json"]={sha256:"e15f41c1e7224253183300742c486589422f2f73f62018240e1d1ad2875a6a71",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-5d2632ff75600259","url":"https://www.xanadu.ai/blog/lighting-up-the-quantum-computing-horizon-with-aurora","title":"Lighting up the quantum computing horizon with Aurora","titleEn":"Lighting up the quantum computing horizon with Aurora","publisher":"Xanadu","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-052","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-052","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-053","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1"],"title":"PsiQuantum：雙光子融合的成功預算","titleEn":"PsiQuantum: a two-photon fusion success budget","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學允收殘餘偏移小於5 ns；只比較同一時鐘定義的量測，不能把整數槽錯位當抖動。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Use a teaching residual-skew limit of5 ns; compare common-clock measurements and do not confuse bin slips with jitter. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"辨識兩路光子存活與內在融合成功率是不同乘數。","differenceEn":"Distinguish two-photon survival from intrinsic fusion success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。假設L=200 m、群折射率1.5、c=3×10^8 m/s，時間槽50 ns。 槽數K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns)。 代入 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9，得到 20 bins。均勻光纖延遲t=n_g L/c；色散、溫度與接頭延遲需另建項。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。內在融合成功率0.5；兩路總透射均0.8，每秒100000次嘗試。 R=R嘗試×p_f×η₁×η₂。 代入 100000*0.5*0.8**2，得到 32000 events/s。獨立損耗下P成功=p_f η₁η₂；此模型忽略暗計數與錯誤宣告。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Assume L=200 m, group index1.5, c=3×10^8 m/s and 50 ns bins. Bin offset K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns). Substituting 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9 gives 20 bins. Uniform-fiber delay is t=n_g L/c; dispersion, temperature and connectors need separate terms. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Intrinsic success0.5, transmission0.8 on each arm and100000 attempts/s. R=attempt rate×p_f×η1×η2. Substituting 100000*0.5*0.8**2 gives 32000 events/s. With independent loss Psuccess=p_f η1η2; dark counts and false heralds are excluded. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-062","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x"],"title":"矽自旋交換閘：sqrt-SWAP 的面積帳本","titleEn":"Silicon exchange gates: a sqrt-SWAP pulse-area ledger","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學允收殘餘偏移小於5 ns；只比較同一時鐘定義的量測，不能把整數槽錯位當抖動。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Use a teaching residual-skew limit of5 ns; compare common-clock measurements and do not confuse bin slips with jitter. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"從交換頻率求理想半交換時間，說明交換積分而非僅峰值決定旋轉。","differenceEn":"Derive ideal half-swap duration and explain why integrated exchange, not only peak value, sets rotation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。假設L=200 m、群折射率1.5、c=3×10^8 m/s，時間槽50 ns。 槽數K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns)。 代入 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9，得到 20 bins。均勻光纖延遲t=n_g L/c；色散、溫度與接頭延遲需另建項。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。方形模型脈衝J/h=10MHz；無上升時間、洩漏與退相干。 t=1/(4×10MHz)，再換成ns。 代入 1/(4*10e6)*1e9，得到 25 ns。H=J S₁·S₂，以無因次自旋算符表示；sqrt-SWAP需Jt/ħ=π/2，因此t=1/(4J/h)。忽略場梯度。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Assume L=200 m, group index1.5, c=3×10^8 m/s and 50 ns bins. Bin offset K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns). Substituting 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9 gives 20 bins. Uniform-fiber delay is t=n_g L/c; dispersion, temperature and connectors need separate terms. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Square model pulse J/h=10MHz with no rise time, leakage or dephasing. t=1/(4×10MHz), converted tons. Substituting 1/(4*10e6)*1e9 gives 25 ns. For H=J S1·S2 with dimensionless spins, sqrt-SWAP needsJt/ħ=π/2, so t=1/(4J/h), neglecting gradients. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-30f368cdd1d99110","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1","title":"Fusion-based quantum computation","titleEn":"Fusion-based quantum computation","publisher":"Bartolucci et al. / Nature Communications","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-fd900ae8f3096a90","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x","title":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","titleEn":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","publisher":"Philips et al. / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
